    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wait for the truck to return, click to plant and feed the cute kitten to get more coins</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/842ee7fa2c6871c89eed4e45d91ec477.poster.avif?t=1754400900\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/842ee7fa2c6871c89eed4e45d91ec477.webm?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/842ee7fa2c6871c89eed4e45d91ec477.mp4?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collection Guide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of different decorations to collect</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/3af755855462c623e8ed188e2fe2c5d5.poster.avif?t=1754400900\" width=776 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/3af755855462c623e8ed188e2fe2c5d5.webm?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/3af755855462c623e8ed188e2fe2c5d5.mp4?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Region</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock fruits and small animals in different maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/6cd3418b6e6748b303e9682c5b657bb0.poster.avif?t=1754400900\" width=652 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/6cd3418b6e6748b303e9682c5b657bb0.webm?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/6cd3418b6e6748b303e9682c5b657bb0.mp4?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make different juices for customers to buy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/4dc3ac75594aec9e298a37c70563a1b9.poster.avif?t=1754400900\" width=652 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/4dc3ac75594aec9e298a37c70563a1b9.webm?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/4dc3ac75594aec9e298a37c70563a1b9.mp4?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish can provide water nutrients and reduce planting time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/33623ecbad24719c4120231620236620.poster.avif?t=1754400900\" width=652 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/33623ecbad24719c4120231620236620.webm?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/33623ecbad24719c4120231620236620.mp4?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Planting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wait for the truck to return, click to plant and feed the cute kitten to get more coins</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/842ee7fa2c6871c89eed4e45d91ec477.poster.avif?t=1754400900\" width=800 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/842ee7fa2c6871c89eed4e45d91ec477.webm?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/842ee7fa2c6871c89eed4e45d91ec477.mp4?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collection Guide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of different decorations to collect</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/3af755855462c623e8ed188e2fe2c5d5.poster.avif?t=1754400900\" width=776 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/3af755855462c623e8ed188e2fe2c5d5.webm?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/3af755855462c623e8ed188e2fe2c5d5.mp4?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Region</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock fruits and small animals in different maps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/6cd3418b6e6748b303e9682c5b657bb0.poster.avif?t=1754400900\" width=652 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/6cd3418b6e6748b303e9682c5b657bb0.webm?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/6cd3418b6e6748b303e9682c5b657bb0.mp4?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make different juices for customers to buy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/4dc3ac75594aec9e298a37c70563a1b9.poster.avif?t=1754400900\" width=652 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/4dc3ac75594aec9e298a37c70563a1b9.webm?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/4dc3ac75594aec9e298a37c70563a1b9.mp4?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish can provide water nutrients and reduce planting time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/33623ecbad24719c4120231620236620.poster.avif?t=1754400900\" width=652 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/33623ecbad24719c4120231620236620.webm?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648150/extras/33623ecbad24719c4120231620236620.mp4?t=1754400900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
